  "details": "Fresh install of VPM, using hub 3.10.0:\n\n-Running vpm check unity will hang, waiting for hub process to close, unless the hub was already open\n\n-If the hub is already open it reports that no editor is found, and clears the pathToUnityExe field in the settings.json\n\n-This clearing behavior and failure also occurs when creating a new project\n\n-This clearing behavior and failure occurs even if the field is manually set, in my case unity is installed to ~/Unity/Hub/Editor/2022.3.22f1/Editor/Unity, however I do in fact set it to the expanded home directory in the config\n\nvpm version: 0.1.28+4747c32ac685cdc0a1e1aef77a9d49316aa9c13a",
